      <h2>What the funnel asks</h2>
      <p>The ad clicks through to a page that sorts the browsers from the buyers. For fitted wardrobes it asks:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Is it a fitted wardrobe, sliding doors, or a full fitted bedroom?</li>
        <li>Which room, and roughly the size of the space?</li>
        <li>Which town or postcode is it in?</li>
        <li>When are they looking to get it done, and the best number to reach them.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Someone just browsing ideas won't finish it. A homeowner ready to spend on their bedroom will, and that's the enquiry you want.</p>

      <h2>Common questions</h2>
    </div>

